// PLAN-009 T2: minimal `<terminal/>` mount example (native terminal
// component — auto-term engine grid viewport, placeholder-rect stage).
//
// Headless assertion: ui::terminal::minimal_at_example_mounts_terminal_placeholder
// drives this through parse → extract → VmBridge → AuraViewBuilder →
// View::Terminal → VTree and asserts the placeholder node exists.
//
// Real grid rendering (glyphs/damage/cursor) lands in T3; interaction
// (selection/IME/scroll/menu) in T4.

widget TermApp {
    view {
        terminal (key: "main", cols: 40, rows: 10) {}
    }
}
